<title>LEBANON: Lebanon financial markets close for holiday.</title>
<headline>Lebanon financial markets close for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's banks and financial markets were closed on Thursday for a public holiday marking Prophet Mohammad's birthday.</p>
